<title>FRANCE: Alcatel in Havas stake sale talks - source.</title>
<headline>Alcatel in Havas stake sale talks - source.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>French electronics and telecoms group Alcatel Alsthom is in talks concerning the sale of part of its stake in media group Havas to conglomerate Generale des Eaux, a company source told Reuters.</p>
<p>The source added , however, &quot;the talks are not concluded&quot;.</p>
<p>French newspapers said on Monday Generale des Eaux was set to raise its stake in Havas, that Havas would take over a Generale des Eaux stake in pay TV group Canal Plus and that Generale des Eaux was also set to buy part of an Alcatel stake in Havas.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
